  "interpretation": [
    "Quick and pilot vary bead number and sampling simultaneously; they do not isolate bead convergence.",
    "The candidate total rate changes substantially between the two short runs. Neither value is a converged prediction.",
    "The 23 by 2 histogram validates transverse integration, not high-resolution channel topology.",
    "Product branches are finite-time atom-labelled union-side partitions. Endpoint checks are not sustained commitment proofs.",
    "Branch standard errors are conditional on the fixed static factor and are large because only two parent chains were used. PMF uncertainty was not included."
  ]
